# ============================================================================
# Files listed here are NEVER uploaded to Vercel, so they can never be served.
#
# Verified 2026-08-05: Vercel serves any non-code repo file as a static asset.
# BLOG-README.md was live at https://www.boostowl.io/BLOG-README.md before this
# file existed. Anything internal must be listed here.
#
# ⚠️ BEFORE ADDING A LINE, READ THIS
# A serverless function can only bundle files that were uploaded. Three
# functions depend on `includeFiles` in vercel.json:
#
#   api/terms.js · api/privacy.js · api/data-deletion.js  →  legal/**
#   api/post.js                                           →  post.html, posts/**
#
# Ignoring legal/, post.html, or posts/ would break the Meta / WhatsApp
# scraper fix. See PROTECTED-ROUTES.md. Never add a broad pattern like `*.md`
# — it would swallow posts/*.md and break the blog.
# ============================================================================

# Internal documentation ------------------------------------------------------
README.md
BLOG-README.md
CAREERS-ADMIN.md
PROTECTED-ROUTES.md

# Database migrations — must never be publicly readable -----------------------
db/

# Local tooling ---------------------------------------------------------------
scripts/

# Secrets (belt and braces; .gitignore already covers these) ------------------
.env
.env.*

# Editor / OS noise -----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.idea/
*.swp

# Optional: 13 work-in-progress screenshots, ~1 MB, referenced only by
# README.md. Currently public at /uploads/*. Left deployed on purpose — the
# URLs may have been shared externally. Uncomment only if you are sure.
# uploads/
